7. TLA+ SKELETON

```tla
------------------------- MODULE STT1024_A7_Memory --------------------------
EXTENDS Naturals, FiniteSets, Sequences,
        STT1024_A4_State,
        STT1024_A1_FSM

CONSTANTS
    W,              \* BWS window size
    N_log_max,      \* Max AOL length before archive/halt
    H               \* Hash function (abstract)
    SK_Sign         \* SK-1024 signature function (abstract)

ASSUME WPos         == W \in Nat /\ W > 0
ASSUME NLogPos      == N_log_max \in Nat /\ N_log_max > 0

\* AOL entry
Entry == [
    seq          : Nat,
    timestamp    : Nat,
    transition   : STRING,       \* simplified record type tag
    prev_hash    : Nat,
    entry_hash   : Nat,
    signature    : Nat
]

\* BWS observation
Observation == Nat               \* abstract state projection

VARIABLES
    aol,        \* Sequence of Entry
    bws         \* Sequence of Observation

vars == <<aol, bws>>

Init ==
    /\ aol = <<>>
    /\ bws = <<>>

\* Append to AOL — monotonic, no rewrite.
AppendEntry(entry) ==
    LET prev == IF Len(aol) = 0 THEN 0 ELSE aol[Len(aol)].entry_hash
        chained == [e \in Entry |-> entry]
        chained2 == [chained EXCEPT !.prev_hash = prev,
                                !.entry_hash = H(entry),
                                !.signature = SK_Sign(entry)]
    IN aol' = Append(aol, chained2)

\* Push to BWS — window slides.
PushObservation(obs) ==
    LET new_bws == <<obs>> \o SubSeq(bws, 1, W - 1)
    IN bws' = new_bws

Next ==
    \/ \E entry \in Entry : AppendEntry(entry) /\ UNCHANGED bws
    \/ \E obs \in Observation : PushObservation(obs) /\ UNCHANGED aol

\* Invariants
AOL_AppendOnly == [][
    Len(aol') >= Len(aol) /\
    \A i \in 1..Len(aol) : aol'[i] = aol[i]
]_vars

BWS_FixedSize == [] (Len(bws) <= W)

\* Properties
AOL_ChainValid ==
    \A i \in 2..Len(aol) :
        aol[i].prev_hash = aol[i-1].entry_hash

BWS_Deterministic ==
    \A step \in Nat : TRUE  \* follows from deterministic push rule

\* Theorems
THEOREM Finiteness == [] (Len(aol) < N_log_max + 1 /\ Len(bws) <= W)
THEOREM TamperEvidence == AOL_ChainValid

=============================================================================
```

